OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum marks 60 years celebrating
OL,4,Acounty's heritage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA museum that showcases the history of
OL,7,FOxfordshire and its people is
OL,8,Fcelebrating its 60th birthday this
OL,9,Fweek.
OL,11,FThe Oxfordshire Museum in Woodstock
OL,12,Fdisplays treasures dating as far back
OL,13,Fas the Roman occupation of Britain all
OL,14,Fthe way to artefacts to the 20th
OL,15,FCentury.
OL,17,FOn Thursday, the museum that first
OL,18,Fopened in 1966 will celebrate its
OL,19,Fdiamond jubilee with a special event
OL,20,Ftracing its own story over the past six
OL,21,Fdecades.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
